rapidai-rapidocronnx provides CMake targets:

    find_package(unofficial-rapidocronnx CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::rapidocronnx::rapidocronnx)

The C API (<rapidocronnx/OcrLiteCApi.h>) needs no OpenCV include path.
The dictionary is in share/rapidai-rapidocronnx/models; the ONNX models are not included.
